      "description": "刪除已完成任務：舊版在 /admin/template/[id] 按「刪除」（app/actions.ts#deleteAssignment）與新版 DELETE kind=assignment，各用一份相同 fixture，回讀指派、勾選紀錄、協作者與範本殘留。新版另寫稽核紀錄（M3 Q2）。",
      "legacy": {
        "serverAction": {
          "file": "app/actions.ts",
          "name": "deleteAssignment"
        }
      },
      "native": {
        "api": {
          "path": "/api/workspace/task-management",
          "method": "DELETE"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "delete-template-completed",
      "mechanism": "write-readback",
      "description": "刪除流程模板（底下任務都已完成）：舊版卡片選單「刪除整個流程模板」（deleteTemplate）與新版 DELETE kind=template（需輸入標題）。回讀範本、指派、勾選紀錄、協作者殘留；新版另寫稽核紀錄。",
      "legacy": {
        "serverAction": {
          "file": "app/actions.ts",
          "name": "deleteTemplate"
        }
      },
      "native": {
        "api": {
          "path": "/api/workspace/task-management",
          "method": "DELETE"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "delete-template-active",
      "mechanism": "write-readback",
      "description": "刪除流程模板（底下還有待處理任務）：舊版直接連帶刪除；新版擋下並提示先完成或封存（M3 Q1）。",
      "legacy": {
        "serverAction": {
          "file": "app/actions.ts",
          "name": "deleteTemplate"
        }
      },
      "native": {
        "api": {
          "path": "/api/workspace/task-management",
          "method": "DELETE"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "list-templates",
      "mechanism": "ui-extract",
      "description": "模板列表：同一批測試範本（含一個沒有未封存任務的、一個剛建立的），舊版 /admin/templates 卡片標題與新版列表比對。新版全部顯示並標示尚未指派（M3 Q3）。",
